{% slide title="AI as a tool to connect" %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_3_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_3_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A personal assistant: AI helps you search for information to go out and connect with others.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_3_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_3_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Find opportunities: Discover associations, interest groups, and events near you.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Search activities and interests" %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Tailored options: Tell AI what you like, and it will give you personalized ideas.

A variety of plans: Find courses, art, sports, music, or volunteering.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_4_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_4_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Accessibility and Inclusion" %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
Artificial Intelligence helps you find places where you feel comfortable:

No barriers: Finds places that are easy to enter, with ramps or elevators.

Quiet places: Finds spaces without too much noise so you can relax.

Clear information: Ask AI to explain things using Easy-to-Read format.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_5_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_5_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="How to ask AI for ideas" %}
Talking to AI is like asking a friend for help:

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_6_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_6_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Say what you like: Write or speak to your phone using simple words.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_6_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_6_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Say where you want to go: Explain if you prefer staying near home or going with friends.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_6_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_6_Freeform_9.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Clear messages: If you explain well what you want, AI gives you better ideas
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Examples of prompts" %}
You can ask AI for plans using these examples:

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_7_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_7_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Example 1: Find a fun workshop in my neighborhood (name) for Saturday mornings.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_7_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_7_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Example 2: Tell me quiet places without noise to have a drink with my friends in my city (name of the city).
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Keep asking the AI" %}
If you don't fully like the plan, you can keep talking to the AI!

{% columns %}
{% column %}
Ask for other plans: If you don't like the first idea, tell it: "Give me different options”.

Ask for more details: You can ask how to get there, how much it costs, or what to wear.

Adjust the search: Tell AI if you prefer a closer, cheaper, or quieter place
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_8_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_8_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Keep asking the AI" %}
If you don't fully like the plan, you can keep talking to the AI!

{% columns %}
{% column %}
Ask for other plans: If you don't like the first idea, tell it: "Give me different options".

Ask for more details: You can ask how to get there, how much it costs, or what to wear.

Adjust the search: Tell AI if you prefer a closer, cheaper, or quieter place
{% /column %}
