{% slide title="Making your own decisions" %}
You are in charge and you choose what you like:

{% columns %}
{% column %}
AI gives options: It shows you several ideas, but you decide.

Choose your favorite: Pick the plan that makes you feel happy and confident.

Ask if unsure: You can review the ideas with your family or support person.
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_10_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_10_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="From idea to action" %}
Prepare your outing step by step:

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_11_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Check time and place: See what day it is and how you will get there.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_11_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Invite others: Suggest the plan to your friends or group.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/8-2/slide_11_Freeform_9.png)
